              }
            ]
          },
          "statement": "For finite CW X, E^2_{p,q}=H_p(X;h_q(*)) and d_r:(p,q)↦(p-r,q+r-1). For each total degree n set F_p h_n(X)=im(h_n(X^p)→h_n(X)); then E^∞_{p,q}=F_p h_{p+q}(X)/F_{p-1}h_{p+q}(X).",
