          "kind": "lemma",
          "proof_plan": "Given skeletal pair exact couples, apply the exact-couple subquotient theorem and compute stable numerators and denominators in both variances. Prove quotient maps by explicit kernel/lift calculations; specialize extreme columns. No E2 identification or general reduced/pair correspondence is used.",
          "provenance": {
